{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-12-18","kind":"proposition","title":"球体积之比等于直径立方之比","englishTitle":"Spheres are to one another in the triplicate ratio of their respective diameters.","book":12,"number":18,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.18","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.18/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":18,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","contentId":"euclid-12-18","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d714f048d37cc5d256911b5d49821d72163aed57d1f86369f2d90f4fd53191c4","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-12-18.statement","euclid-12-18.construction.1","euclid-12-18.proof.1","euclid-12-18.proof.2","euclid-12-18.proof.3","euclid-12-18.proof.4","euclid-12-18.proof.5","euclid-12-18.proof.6","euclid-12-18.proof.7","euclid-12-18.proof.8","euclid-12-18.proof.9","euclid-12-18.proof.10","euclid-12-18.proof.11","euclid-12-18.proof.12","euclid-12-18.proof.13","euclid-12-18.conclusion","euclid-12-18.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-12-18.statement","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3c3153e00f1591be907640742c7a4ba4cd5e528e230a674ac56c6a1358dddc63","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Spheres are to one another in the triplicate ratio of their respective diameters."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"球体在立方比直径上相互连接"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf0f1f45caeea9b7874ca81acd7ba9e208579708ddc62facf7a74ee80e61d739","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the spheres ABC, DEF be conceived, and let BC, EF be their diameters; I say that the sphere ABC has to the sphere DEF the ratio triplicate of that which BC has to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC,DEF球体被构思,让BC,EF球体直径;我说,ABC球体与DEF球体的比重是BC至EF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c6c35d8db2edfdfd20a633ce8bbb22fc62b71fa49f640ce3b8e5ffa4670e0229","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if the sphere ABC has not to the sphere DEF the ratio triplicate of that which BC has to EF, then the sphere ABC will have either to some less sphere than the sphere DEF, or to a greater, the ratio triplicate of that which BC has to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果ABC球没有与DEF球的比重,BC比EF,那么ABC球的比重,要么比DEF球少一些,要么比BC比EF大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"24c108596849ff6ee81110032c2dd308a66068594062e4f2f61aad29e3369de3","citations":["euclid-12-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let it have that ratio to a less sphere GHK, let DEF be conceived about the same centre with GHK, let there be inscribed in the greater sphere DEF a polyhedral solid which does not touch the lesser sphere GHK at its surface, [[XII. 17](/principles/euclid-12-17)] and let there also be inscribed in the sphere ABC a polyhedral solid similar to the polyhedral solid in the sphere DEF; therefore the polyhedral solid in ABC has to the polyhedral solid in DEF the ratio triplicate of that which BC has to EF. [[XII. 17, Por.](/principles/euclid-12-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让它将这一比与较小球体GHK的比相比,让DEF的测算中心与GHK的同一中心相近,让DEF大球体在较大球体DEF上刻上一个与GHK的球体GHK不相接触的多面体体固体,让ABC球体也刻上一个与DEF球体多面体固体类似的多面体固体;因此,ABC的多面体固体与DEF的多面体固体之比是BC的3倍数。 [[XII. 17](/principles/euclid-12-17)] [[XII. 17, Por.](/principles/euclid-12-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9341a1ddbc9cf6ec955c9f5b1618e9743d08fd5d4fb0fdd95954b1899c5b4db","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the sphere ABC also has to the sphere GHK the ratio triplicate of that which BC has to EF; therefore, as the sphere ABC is to the sphere GHK, so is the polyhedral solid in the sphere ABC to the polyhedral solid in the sphere DEF; and, alternately, as the sphere ABC is to the polyhedron in it, so is the sphere GHK to the polyhedral solid in the sphere DEF. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,ABC球体与GHK球体的比是BC球体与EF球体的三重比;因此,ABC球体与GHK球体的比等于ABC球体的多重固体体与DEF球体的多重固体体的比;另外,ABC球体与DEF球体的多重体体体体的比等于GHK球体与GHK球体的多重体体体体体体的比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b1fc7c03fadbc64530d89be5150c0dc0521c9be43760e664084f26565784b0ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the sphere ABC is greater than the polyhedron in it; therefore the sphere GHK is also greater than the polyhedron in the sphere DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ABC球大于其中的聚希德龙;因此,GHK球也大于DEF球中的聚希德龙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d4616d7d116a8130f8939e7c41598ba6ac85135caaaf2a3351d6cda16dff9cc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is also less, for it is enclosed by it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也更少,因为它被它包住。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1892f401edc8a0db7ff01efb64f6b1e03686ab3b2767f364c0a0a91a7b9b9bfb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the sphere ABC has not to a less sphere than the sphere DEF the ratio triplicate of that which the diameter BC has to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ABC球的面积不小于DEF球的面积,即直径BC至EF的面积的三倍比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3375c362e7bbd292262a9af0c1b1ddaeca6d13da6a159c449ef38179955f7898","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither has the sphere DEF to a less sphere than the sphere ABC the ratio triplicate of that which EF has to BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,DEF至ABC的面积与EF至BC的面积之比,两者都不如。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e117d5fb88a89a8af7bfbe130e7072f7d2b957f215da1a0b1d50c7d1a108830","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that neither has the sphere ABC to any greater sphere than the sphere DEF the ratio triplicate of that which BC has to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我要说的是,ABC球的面积比BC球的面积的三倍比DEF球的面积都小。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e0db6a6f9c9bfe6f3d3c0bd278316b22645ae8f90ecb05e98af66eb27e78105e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it have that ratio to a greater, LMN; therefore, inversely, the sphere LMN has to the sphere ABC the ratio triplicate of that which the diameter EF has to the diameter BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,让它的比重更大,为LMN;因此,反过来,LMN球与ABC球的比是直径EF的三重,直径为BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a9e62e12c9e99dc648eae5dfeb9be711e751df209e4b7395c53dd0cf154d69dc","citations":["euclid-12-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, inasmuch as LMN is greater than DEF, therefore, as the sphere LMN is to the sphere ABC, so is the sphere DEF to some less sphere than the sphere ABC, as was before proved. [[XII. 2, Lemma](/principles/euclid-12-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,由于LMN领域大于DEF领域,LMN领域与ABC领域的比相当于DEF领域与ABC领域之间的比,这一点以前已经证明。 [[XII. 2, 引理](/principles/euclid-12-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ab78e7ad968499bb4c604d71777b30ac3ce2e1367118c97c000f5427133b3f6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the sphere DEF also has to some less sphere than the sphere ABC the ratio triplicate of that which EF has to BC: which was proved impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DEF球体的面积也比ABC球体的面积少,EF球体的比重是BC球体的三倍:事实证明这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a4a7b4bc56d43fb644be91757bf410963b1d2090ec0e31ca12800863a0ef8ce","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the sphere ABC has not to any sphere greater than the sphere DEF the ratio triplicate of that which BC has to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ABC球体的面积不超过BC球体至EF球体的三倍。（相关点与线段：DEF）"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a8222a9c99e3318a365429379885ec7a258da3f40d0cbf703b6bfd6489e15e26","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was proved that neither has it that ratio to a less sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但事实证明,两者的比例都没有降低。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"038b6acfeb1e8901abb508993489d1452830769746306f9985df731443d3990f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the sphere ABC has to the sphere DEF the ratio triplicate of that which BC has to EF. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ABC球体与DEF球体的比重是BC,与EF球体的比重是Q,ED。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-18.source","contentId":"euclid-12-18","revisionId":"euclid-12-18@raw-d714f048d37cc5d2","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf38186aa23ce86f506f9f5f73513833465b81d268f0a397f513e9017200d4f1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.18/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.18\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-18:euclid-12-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-18.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"XII. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-18:euclid-5-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-18.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"V. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-18:euclid-12-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-18.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"XII. 2, Lemma"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-18:euclid-12-17:explicit","id":"euclid-12-17","book":12,"number":17,"kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：球与切线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-18:euclid-5-16:explicit","id":"euclid-5-16","book":5,"number":16,"kind":"proposition","title":"比例的交错变换","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-18:euclid-12-2:explicit","id":"euclid-12-2","book":12,"number":2,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆面积之比等于直径平方之比","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-solid","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
